Package: openmediavault-immich
Architecture: all
Depends: openmediavault (>= 8.0), openmediavault-compose, rsync
Priority: optional
Description: openmediavault Immich plugin
 Manage the Immich photo library (self-hosted Google Photos alternative)
 from the OpenMediaVault web interface. The Docker Compose stack
 (immich-server, redis, database and the optional machine-learning
 service) is registered in the openmediavault-compose plugin, so it
 follows the Compose plugin conventions and can be inspected, edited
 and started on the Compose page; the plugin provides start/stop/
 restart/update buttons, reports the live container status, the running
 Immich version and available upstream updates and can migrate the
 photo library and the database folders. Includes Chinese translations.
